{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "aura_cadence",
  "spec": ["aura 5.1", "aura 6.4", "aura 6.5", "aura 17.14"],
  "description": "SimNewDay runs DoIdle(5) first, then returns false iff state != 0 and state < date - cycleStart (unsigned): cycle started on day 1000, on day 1005 state 3 becomes 4 (no departments) and 4 < 5 -> false; state 6 -> 7 -> true; state 0 -> true; SimNewMonth only restarts an idle pipeline (5 stays 5, 0 -> 1); SimIdle steps with data3 ms; a date before the start wraps to a large unsigned difference -> false. A full cycle with one lot is 17 calls (one per state 1..17; state 3 with no department and state 5 with one lot take one call each) with one history record and one 0x2A09B21A; with no lots the cycle ends at state 4 after taking the iterator, without history or post. Hand-derived. Test 14 as answered (5.1: the comparison uses the state after the step): cycle start 1000, day 1005, state 3 with department 0x10 left -> one department (cursor 0x10), state 3, false; state 3 with every department processed -> publish, state 4, false; state 4 with lots -> state 5, 5 < 5 fails -> true (comparing before the step would give false). Day 1006, state 5 with 2 lots and a clock that expires after one read per call (step 1024: the clock is read before every lot): the first delivery stamps lot 1 and stops (state 5, 5 < 6 -> false), the second stamps lot 2 and stops at the next read (false), the third finds the end (state 6, 6 < 6 fails -> true). An empty lot list ends the cycle in state 4 (state 0, true) with only the lot iterator taken.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 1000, "lots": [{"rect": [0, 0, 0, 0], "pops": [[4112, 1]]}]},
    {"op": "aura_create"},
    {"op": "aura_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 2, "cycle_start_day": 1000}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 1005},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 3}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 6}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 7}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 990},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimIdle", "data3": 20, "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 2, "cycle_start_day": 990}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 3, "cycle_start_day": 1000}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimBegin", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_run", "expect_calls": 17},
    {"op": "aura_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "history"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "aura_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "post", "type": "0x2A09B21A"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "aura_env", "lots": null},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_run", "expect_calls": 4},
    {"op": "aura_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "lot_iterator"}]},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "lots": [{"rect": [0, 0, 0, 0], "pops": [[4112, 1]]}], "date": 1005},
    {"op": "aura_set_grid", "grid": "dept:0x10", "cells": [[0, 0, 5]]},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 3, "department_cursor": null, "cycle_start_day": 1000}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 3, "department_cursor": 16}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 4, "department_cursor": null}},
    {"op": "aura_expect_grid", "grid": "landmark_map", "cells": [[0, 0, 5]], "others": 0},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5, "lot_iterator": true}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "lots": [{"rect": [0, 0, 0, 0], "pops": [[4112, 1]]}, {"rect": [1, 1, 1, 1], "pops": [[4112, 1]]}]},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_idle", "expect_state": 5},
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 1006, "timer_reads_before_expiry": 1},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_expect_grid", "grid": "work", "cells": [[0, 0, 0]], "others": -128},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_expect_grid", "grid": "work", "cells": [[0, 0, 0], [1, 1, 0]], "others": -128},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 6, "lot_iterator": false}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "lots": null, "timer_reads_before_expiry": null},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "aura_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "lot_iterator"}]}
  ]
}
